[
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.17,
"text": "On the fourth of May,"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 1.17,
"t1": 2.68,
"text": "2023, a"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 2.68,
"t1": 4.04,
"text": "Swiss sailing yacht called"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 4.04,
"t1": 5.55,
"text": "Champagne was motoring"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 5.55,
"t1": 7.46,
"text": "through the Strait of Gibraltar."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 7.46,
"t1": 9.08,
"text": "Then the crew felt the first"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 9.08,
"t1": 10.73,
"text": "hit. Three orcas"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 10.73,
"t1": 12.35,
"text": "had come up behind the boat."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 12.35,
"t1": 13.85,
"text": "The biggest one rammed the hull"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 13.85,
"t1": 14.94,
"text": "from the side."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 14.94,
"t1": 16.55,
"text": "The two smaller ones went straight"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 16.55,
"t1": 17.65,
"text": "for the rudder, and shook it."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 17.65,
"t1": 18.75,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 18.75,
"t1": 19.82,
"text": "The crew noticed something strange."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 19.82,
"t1": 20.89,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 20.89,
"t1": 22.52,
"text": "The two small orcas were copying"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 22.52,
"t1": 23.6,
"text": "the big one."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 23.6,
"t1": 25.35,
"text": "Watching, then doing the same"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 25.35,
"t1": 26.7,
"text": "thing. Like they were being taught."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 26.7,
"t1": 28.04,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 28.04,
"t1": 29.79,
"text": "By the time it was over, the rudder"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 29.79,
"t1": 31.74,
"text": "had two holes punched through it."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 31.74,
"t1": 33.68,
"text": "The boat was taking on water."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 33.68,
"t1": 34.69,
"text": "And the orcas were gone."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 34.69,
"t1": 35.7,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 35.7,
"t1": 37.41,
"text": "This was not an accident."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 37.41,
"t1": 38.87,
"text": "It was not the first time."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 38.87,
"t1": 40.84,
"text": "And it would not be the last."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 40.84,
"t1": 42.48,
"text": "So why did one small family"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 42.48,
"t1": 43.98,
"text": "of orcas start breaking"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 43.98,
"t1": 45.02,
"text": "boats? In this story,"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 45.02,
"t1": 46.05,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 46.05,
"t1": 47.55,
"text": "you will find out who started"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 47.55,
"t1": 49.11,
"text": "it. Why they only go"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 49.11,
"t1": 50.93,
"text": "for the rudder. And what happens"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 50.93,
"t1": 52.92,
"text": "when people start fighting back."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.81,
"text": "To understand this story,"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 1.81,
"t1": 2.87,
"text": "you have to start with a place."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 2.87,
"t1": 3.93,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 3.93,
"t1": 5.47,
"text": "The Strait of Gibraltar is a"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 5.47,
"t1": 6.86,
"text": "narrow door between two"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 6.86,
"t1": 7.95,
"text": "continents."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 7.95,
"t1": 9.58,
"text": "Spain on one side."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 9.58,
"t1": 11.07,
"text": "Morocco on the other."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 11.07,
"t1": 12.61,
"text": "At its tightest, only"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 12.61,
"t1": 14.55,
"text": "about fourteen kilometres of water"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 14.55,
"t1": 15.68,
"text": "separate Europe from Africa."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 15.68,
"t1": 16.8,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 16.8,
"t1": 18.47,
"text": "Every ship that wants to go between"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 18.47,
"t1": 20.22,
"text": "the Atlantic and the Mediterranean"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 20.22,
"t1": 21.98,
"text": "has to squeeze through it."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 21.98,
"t1": 23.16,
"text": "Tankers. Cargo ships."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 23.16,
"t1": 24.33,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 24.33,
"t1": 25.58,
"text": "Ferries. Fishing boats."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 25.58,
"t1": 26.83,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 26.83,
"t1": 28.66,
"text": "And every spring, thousands"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 28.66,
"t1": 30.39,
"text": "of sailing yachts, heading"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 30.39,
"t1": 31.77,
"text": "south for the sun."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 31.77,
"t1": 33.29,
"text": "But the strait is also a door"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 33.29,
"t1": 34.61,
"text": "for something else."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 2.0,
"text": "Every spring, huge Atlantic"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 2.0,
"t1": 3.53,
"text": "bluefin tuna pour through"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 3.53,
"t1": 4.76,
"text": "the strait on their way to the"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 4.76,
"t1": 5.99,
"text": "Mediterranean."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 5.99,
"t1": 7.59,
"text": "And waiting for them is a small"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 7.59,
"t1": 9.17,
"text": "group of orcas."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 9.17,
"t1": 10.85,
"text": "They are not like the orcas you might know"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 10.85,
"t1": 12.23,
"text": "from the cold north."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 12.23,
"t1": 13.98,
"text": "These are tuna specialists."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 13.98,
"t1": 15.76,
"text": "They chase a single tuna for a long"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 15.76,
"t1": 17.26,
"text": "time, matching it turn"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 17.26,
"t1": 18.87,
"text": "for turn, until the fish"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 18.87,
"t1": 20.06,
"text": "is too tired to escape."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 20.06,
"t1": 21.25,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 21.25,
"t1": 22.3,
"text": "Some of them learned a shortcut, too."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 22.3,
"t1": 23.36,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 23.36,
"t1": 25.18,
"text": "When local fishermen haul up tuna"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 25.18,
"t1": 26.72,
"text": "on long lines, a few"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 26.72,
"t1": 28.23,
"text": "of these orcas simply wait"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 28.23,
"t1": 29.78,
"text": "beside the boat and take the"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 29.78,
"t1": 31.27,
"text": "fish off the hook."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 31.27,
"t1": 32.65,
"text": "They follow the tuna."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 32.65,
"t1": 33.82,
"text": "Through the strait in spring and summer."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 33.82,
"t1": 34.99,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 34.99,
"t1": 36.66,
"text": "Then north, along the coast"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 36.66,
"t1": 38.55,
"text": "of Portugal, up to Galicia"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 38.55,
"t1": 40.31,
"text": "in the far north of Spain."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.65,
"text": "These orcas are called the"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 1.65,
"t1": 3.22,
"text": "Iberian orcas, and"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 3.22,
"t1": 4.96,
"text": "there are very few of them."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 4.96,
"t1": 6.56,
"text": "When scientists counted every"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 6.56,
"t1": 8.25,
"text": "single one in 2011,"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 8.25,
"t1": 10.15,
"text": "they found thirty-nine."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 10.15,
"t1": 11.9,
"text": "Thirty-nine animals, in"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 11.9,
"t1": 13.55,
"text": "five family groups."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 13.55,
"t1": 14.62,
"text": "That's it."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 14.62,
"t1": 15.76,
"text": "That is the whole population."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 15.76,
"t1": 16.9,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 16.9,
"t1": 18.8,
"text": "In 2019, the International"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 18.8,
"t1": 20.73,
"text": "Union for Conservation of Nature"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 20.73,
"t1": 21.86,
"text": "listed them as critically endangered."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 21.86,
"t1": 22.98,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 22.98,
"t1": 24.55,
"text": "One bad decade could wipe them"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 24.55,
"t1": 26.36,
"text": "out. For years, almost"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 26.36,
"t1": 28.24,
"text": "nobody outside Spain and Portugal"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 28.24,
"t1": 29.68,
"text": "knew they existed."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 29.68,
"t1": 31.24,
"text": "That was about to change."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.7,
"text": "In May 2020,"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 1.7,
"t1": 3.44,
"text": "the world had gone quiet."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 3.44,
"t1": 4.89,
"text": "Ports were closed."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 4.89,
"t1": 5.93,
"text": "Most boats stayed tied up."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 5.93,
"t1": 6.97,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 6.97,
"t1": 8.61,
"text": "That month, in the Strait of"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 8.61,
"t1": 10.12,
"text": "Gibraltar, an orca"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 10.12,
"t1": 11.65,
"text": "came up behind a sailboat and"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 11.65,
"t1": 13.08,
"text": "touched the rudder."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 13.08,
"t1": 14.18,
"text": "Then it happened again in July."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 14.18,
"t1": 15.29,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 15.29,
"t1": 17.04,
"text": "In the strait, and off the coast"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 17.04,
"t1": 18.15,
"text": "of Portugal."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 18.15,
"t1": 19.72,
"text": "By August, sailors"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 19.72,
"t1": 21.67,
"text": "far to the north, off Galicia,"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 21.67,
"t1": 22.76,
"text": "were reporting the same thing."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 22.76,
"t1": 23.85,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 23.85,
"t1": 25.02,
"text": "Orcas, coming up from behind."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 25.02,
"t1": 26.18,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 26.18,
"t1": 27.43,
"text": "Pushing the rudder."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 27.43,
"t1": 29.15,
"text": "And at the wheel, the sailors"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 29.15,
"t1": 31.13,
"text": "felt it turn in their hands,"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 31.13,
"t1": 32.79,
"text": "all on its own."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 32.79,
"t1": 34.41,
"text": "Between July and November of"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 34.41,
"t1": 36.05,
"text": "2020, fifty-two"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 36.05,
"t1": 37.16,
"text": "of these encounters were reported."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 37.16,
"t1": 38.27,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 38.27,
"t1": 40.13,
"text": "Scientists from Spain and Portugal"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 40.13,
"t1": 41.72,
"text": "set up a working group in August"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 41.72,
"t1": 43.3,
"text": "that year, just to keep track of"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 43.3,
"t1": 43.86,
"text": "it."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.86,
"text": "What they do is strangely"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 1.86,
"t1": 2.97,
"text": "precise."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 2.97,
"t1": 4.65,
"text": "The orcas come in quietly from"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 4.65,
"t1": 6.19,
"text": "behind. They ignore the"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 6.19,
"t1": 7.84,
"text": "hull, the sails, the"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 7.84,
"t1": 9.55,
"text": "people. They go for one part"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 9.55,
"t1": 10.55,
"text": "of the boat: the rudder."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 10.55,
"t1": 11.56,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 11.56,
"t1": 13.18,
"text": "They push it with their heads."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 13.18,
"t1": 14.22,
"text": "They lever it with their bodies."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 14.22,
"t1": 15.27,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 15.27,
"t1": 16.8,
"text": "Some of them bite it."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 16.8,
"t1": 18.39,
"text": "With enough pushing, they can spin"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 18.39,
"t1": 19.52,
"text": "a boat almost all the way around."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 19.52,
"t1": 20.66,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 20.66,
"t1": 22.55,
"text": "When the boats were checked afterwards,"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 22.55,
"t1": 24.22,
"text": "people found tooth marks raked"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 24.22,
"t1": 26.08,
"text": "across the keel and the rudder."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 26.08,
"t1": 27.48,
"text": "Some rudders were bent."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 27.48,
"t1": 29.22,
"text": "Some were split in half."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 29.22,
"t1": 30.77,
"text": "Some were simply gone."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 30.77,
"t1": 32.44,
"text": "At least one orca was seen"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 32.44,
"t1": 33.59,
"text": "tearing a rudder off with its teeth."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 33.59,
"t1": 34.75,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 34.75,
"t1": 36.7,
"text": "And they chose their targets."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 36.7,
"t1": 38.54,
"text": "Most were sailing boats about twelve"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 38.54,
"t1": 40.15,
"text": "metres long, moving at"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 40.15,
"t1": 41.75,
"text": "around six knots."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 41.75,
"t1": 43.34,
"text": "Slow enough for an orca to catch"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 43.34,
"t1": 44.38,
"text": "with ease."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.5,
"text": "Scientists can tell every"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 1.5,
"t1": 3.2,
"text": "orca apart by the shape of its"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 3.2,
"t1": 4.9,
"text": "fin and the grey patch behind"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 4.9,
"t1": 6.58,
"text": "it. So they started to work"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 6.58,
"t1": 7.7,
"text": "out exactly who was doing this."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 7.7,
"t1": 8.81,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 8.81,
"t1": 10.33,
"text": "They gave every orca that touched"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 10.33,
"t1": 11.4,
"text": "a boat the same first name:"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 11.4,
"t1": 12.47,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 12.47,
"t1": 13.55,
"text": "Gladis."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 13.55,
"t1": 15.06,
"text": "It comes from an old scientific"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 15.06,
"t1": 16.23,
"text": "name for the orca, gladiator."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 16.23,
"t1": 17.4,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 17.4,
"t1": 18.58,
"text": "In a study published in"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 18.58,
"t1": 20.15,
"text": "2022, they found"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 20.15,
"t1": 21.68,
"text": "that nine orcas had touched"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 21.68,
"t1": 22.69,
"text": "the boats."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 22.69,
"t1": 24.58,
"text": "They came from two families."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 24.58,
"t1": 26.19,
"text": "In the first family was an adult"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 26.19,
"t1": 28.11,
"text": "female called Gladis Blanca."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 28.11,
"t1": 29.53,
"text": "White Gladis."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 29.53,
"t1": 31.35,
"text": "With her were her sisters,"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 31.35,
"t1": 33.05,
"text": "Gladis Dalila and Gladis"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 33.05,
"t1": 34.56,
"text": "Clara, and later her"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 34.56,
"t1": 36.09,
"text": "own calf, born in"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 36.09,
"t1": 37.52,
"text": "2021."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 37.52,
"t1": 39.05,
"text": "The second family was"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 39.05,
"t1": 40.59,
"text": "a gang of youngsters."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 40.59,
"t1": 42.15,
"text": "Gladis Gris, Grey"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 42.15,
"t1": 43.29,
"text": "Gladis. And two siblings,"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 43.29,
"t1": 44.43,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 44.43,
"t1": 46.19,
"text": "Gladis Peque and Gladis"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 46.19,
"t1": 47.35,
"text": "Negra. Black Gladis."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 47.35,
"t1": 48.51,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 48.51,
"t1": 50.14,
"text": "By 2023, the"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 50.14,
"t1": 51.93,
"text": "list had grown to fifteen."
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.77,
"text": "For two years, the orcas"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 1.77,
"t1": 3.49,
"text": "broke rudders and left."
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 3.49,
"t1": 5.25,
"text": "Boats were towed into port,"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 5.25,
"t1": 7.15,
"text": "repaired and sent back out."
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 7.15,
"t1": 9.11,
"text": "The encounters kept coming."
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 9.11,
"t1": 10.57,
"text": "One hundred and ninety-seven in"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 10.57,
"t1": 11.8,
"text": "2021."
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 11.8,
"t1": 12.95,
"text": "Two hundred and seven in"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 12.95,
"t1": 14.64,
"text": "2022."
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 14.64,
"t1": 15.73,
"text": "Then, in July"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 15.73,
"t1": 17.37,
"text": "2022, off"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 17.37,
"t1": 18.91,
"text": "the coast of Portugal,"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 18.91,
"t1": 20.55,
"text": "a sailboat with five people"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 20.55,
"t1": 22.53,
"text": "aboard took so much damage"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 22.53,
"t1": 23.92,
"text": "that it sank."
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 23.92,
"t1": 25.1,
"text": "In November, it happened again."
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 25.1,
"t1": 26.28,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 26.28,
"t1": 27.84,
"text": "A yacht called Smousse,"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 27.84,
"t1": 29.36,
"text": "with four people aboard,"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 29.36,
"t1": 31.27,
"text": "went down off Portugal."
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 31.27,
"t1": 32.81,
"text": "Everyone was rescued both"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 32.81,
"t1": 34.38,
"text": "times. But now the"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 34.38,
"t1": 35.87,
"text": "story had changed."
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.5,
"text": "And that brings us back to the"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 1.5,
"t1": 2.9,
"text": "Champagne, in May"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 2.9,
"t1": 4.59,
"text": "2023."
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 4.59,
"t1": 6.16,
"text": "When the three orcas had finished with"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 6.16,
"t1": 8.16,
"text": "her, the rudder was pierced"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 8.16,
"t1": 10.09,
"text": "and its fittings were broken."
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 10.09,
"t1": 11.75,
"text": "Spain's coast guard took the crew"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 11.75,
"t1": 13.26,
"text": "off, and towed the yacht"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 13.26,
"t1": 14.41,
"text": "towards the port of Barbate."
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 14.41,
"t1": 15.55,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 15.55,
"t1": 17.27,
"text": "She made it all the way to the harbour"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 17.27,
"t1": 19.15,
"text": "entrance. And there,"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 19.15,
"t1": 20.68,
"text": "she rolled over."
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 20.68,
"t1": 22.42,
"text": "What frightened people most"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 22.42,
"t1": 24.2,
"text": "was what the crew had seen."
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 24.2,
"t1": 25.96,
"text": "One big orca, showing"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 25.96,
"t1": 27.6,
"text": "the way. Two smaller"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 27.6,
"t1": 29.56,
"text": "ones, copying it."
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 29.56,
"t1": 31.45,
"text": "It looked like a lesson."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.78,
"text": "Within days, the orcas"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 1.78,
"t1": 3.45,
"text": "were everywhere online."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 3.45,
"t1": 5.21,
"text": "People made memes about an orca"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 5.21,
"t1": 6.24,
"text": "uprising."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 6.24,
"t1": 7.45,
"text": "Orca wars."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 7.45,
"t1": 8.9,
"text": "Orcas fighting back against"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 8.9,
"t1": 10.41,
"text": "humans. And a story"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 10.41,
"t1": 12.15,
"text": "spread about White Gladis."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 12.15,
"t1": 13.75,
"text": "The idea was that, years"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 13.75,
"t1": 15.64,
"text": "earlier, she had been hurt."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 15.64,
"t1": 17.28,
"text": "Maybe hit by a boat."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 17.28,
"t1": 19.01,
"text": "Maybe caught in an illegal fishing"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 19.01,
"t1": 20.66,
"text": "net. And now she was taking"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 20.66,
"t1": 22.32,
"text": "revenge, and teaching the young"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 22.32,
"t1": 23.9,
"text": "ones to do the same."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 23.9,
"t1": 25.68,
"text": "It is a powerful story."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 25.68,
"t1": 27.65,
"text": "Scientists did think about it."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 27.65,
"t1": 29.27,
"text": "A painful run-in with a boat"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 29.27,
"t1": 31.11,
"text": "could have started the behaviour."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 31.11,
"t1": 32.75,
"text": "But no one has ever found proof"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 32.75,
"t1": 33.96,
"text": "that it happened."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.11,
"text": "The orcas did not stop."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 1.11,
"t1": 2.22,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 2.22,
"t1": 3.79,
"text": "On the thirty-first of October"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 3.79,
"t1": 5.35,
"text": "2023, a"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 5.35,
"t1": 6.88,
"text": "yacht called Grazie Mamma"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 6.88,
"t1": 8.48,
"text": "Two met a group of them in the"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 8.48,
"t1": 10.13,
"text": "strait. For forty-five"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 10.13,
"t1": 11.67,
"text": "minutes they bumped and pushed the"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 11.67,
"t1": 13.19,
"text": "rudder, until the boat was"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 13.19,
"t1": 14.75,
"text": "leaking. It sank near"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 14.75,
"t1": 16.45,
"text": "the entrance to the port of Tanger"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 16.45,
"t1": 18.43,
"text": "Med, in Morocco."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 18.43,
"t1": 19.36,
"text": "On the twelfth of May"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 19.36,
"t1": 20.95,
"text": "2024, a"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 20.95,
"t1": 22.65,
"text": "Spanish yacht called Alboran"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 22.65,
"t1": 23.73,
"text": "Cognac was holed in the strait."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 23.73,
"t1": 24.81,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 24.81,
"t1": 26.35,
"text": "The two people aboard were picked up"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 26.35,
"t1": 27.86,
"text": "by a passing tanker."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 27.86,
"t1": 29.28,
"text": "The yacht sank."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 29.28,
"t1": 30.99,
"text": "Ten weeks later, a British"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 30.99,
"t1": 32.76,
"text": "yacht called Bonhomie William"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 32.76,
"t1": 33.77,
"text": "went down in the same waters."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 33.77,
"t1": 34.77,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 34.77,
"t1": 36.37,
"text": "Spain's coast guard rescued"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 36.37,
"t1": 37.98,
"text": "all three people aboard."
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.57,
"text": "So why the rudder,"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 1.57,
"t1": 3.14,
"text": "again and again?"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 3.14,
"t1": 4.84,
"text": "One idea is that it is the boat's"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 4.84,
"t1": 5.91,
"text": "weak spot."
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 5.91,
"t1": 7.45,
"text": "Orcas hunt by going for the"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 7.45,
"t1": 9.0,
"text": "tail of their prey, because"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 9.0,
"t1": 10.6,
"text": "the tail is what lets it swim"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 10.6,
"t1": 12.18,
"text": "away. The rudder sits"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 12.18,
"t1": 13.9,
"text": "exactly where a fish's tail would"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 13.9,
"t1": 15.58,
"text": "be. Another researcher"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 15.58,
"t1": 17.13,
"text": "noticed that the orcas seem to"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 17.13,
"t1": 18.28,
"text": "love the feeling of a spinning propeller."
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 18.28,
"t1": 19.43,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 19.43,
"t1": 21.09,
"text": "And when a sailboat turns its engine"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 21.09,
"t1": 22.6,
"text": "off, maybe they go after"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 22.6,
"t1": 23.68,
"text": "the rudder out of frustration."
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 23.68,
"t1": 24.76,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 24.76,
"t1": 26.61,
"text": "And then there is the simplest idea"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 26.61,
"t1": 28.2,
"text": "of all. A rudder is"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 28.2,
"t1": 30.05,
"text": "the one part of a boat that moves"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 30.05,
"t1": 31.29,
"text": "when you push it."
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 31.29,
"t1": 32.95,
"text": "Push it, and the whole boat"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 32.95,
"t1": 34.06,
"text": "turns."
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 34.06,
"t1": 35.65,
"text": "For a young orca, that"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 35.65,
"t1": 36.69,
"text": "might be the best toy in the ocean."
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 36.69,
"t1": 37.72,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 0.78,
"text": "In February"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 0.78,
"t1": 2.15,
"text": "2024,"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 2.15,
"t1": 3.8,
"text": "scientists, sailors and"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 3.8,
"t1": 5.76,
"text": "government officials met in Madrid"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 5.76,
"t1": 7.51,
"text": "to look at all of it together."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 7.51,
"t1": 9.33,
"text": "They found no evidence that the orcas"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 9.33,
"t1": 10.86,
"text": "were being aggressive."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 10.86,
"t1": 11.89,
"text": "Here is what they think is going on."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 11.89,
"t1": 12.92,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 12.92,
"t1": 14.66,
"text": "In recent years, bluefin"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 14.66,
"t1": 16.35,
"text": "tuna numbers in this region have come"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 16.35,
"t1": 17.85,
"text": "back. For the first time"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 17.85,
"t1": 19.39,
"text": "in generations, these"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 19.39,
"t1": 21.31,
"text": "orcas have plenty to eat."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 21.31,
"t1": 22.94,
"text": "And when you are well fed, you"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 22.94,
"t1": 24.81,
"text": "have time on your hands."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 24.81,
"t1": 25.98,
"text": "Orcas have done this kind of thing before."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 25.98,
"t1": 27.16,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 27.16,
"t1": 28.77,
"text": "In 1987, off"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 28.77,
"t1": 30.55,
"text": "the coast of Washington State,"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 30.55,
"t1": 32.38,
"text": "one orca started swimming around"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 32.38,
"t1": 34.08,
"text": "with a dead salmon balanced on its"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 34.08,
"t1": 35.8,
"text": "head. Within weeks,"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 35.8,
"t1": 36.88,
"text": "others in her group were doing it too."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 36.88,
"t1": 37.95,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 37.95,
"t1": 39.59,
"text": "Then, the next year,"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 39.59,
"t1": 41.12,
"text": "they all stopped."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 41.12,
"t1": 42.13,
"text": "Scientists call it a fad."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 42.13,
"t1": 43.15,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 43.15,
"t1": 45.01,
"text": "The rudders may be the same thing."
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.8,
"text": "That also explains what"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 1.8,
"t1": 3.44,
"text": "works. When crews"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 3.44,
"t1": 5.25,
"text": "fought the wheel or sped up,"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 5.25,
"t1": 6.79,
"text": "the orcas pushed harder and"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 6.79,
"t1": 7.86,
"text": "more often."
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 7.86,
"t1": 9.42,
"text": "When the crews stopped the boat and"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 9.42,
"t1": 10.93,
"text": "let go, the orcas"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 10.93,
"t1": 11.93,
"text": "usually got bored and left."
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 11.93,
"t1": 12.94,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 12.94,
"t1": 14.04,
"text": "Some sailors tried something else."
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 14.04,
"t1": 15.15,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 15.15,
"t1": 16.24,
"text": "Firecrackers dropped into the water."
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 16.24,
"t1": 17.33,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 17.33,
"t1": 19.24,
"text": "Even electric shocks."
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 19.24,
"t1": 20.39,
"text": "The scientists' verdict was clear."
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 20.39,
"t1": 21.55,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 21.55,
"t1": 22.68,
"text": "These things do not stop the orcas."
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 22.68,
"t1": 23.81,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 23.81,
"t1": 25.14,
"text": "They may even make the game more"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 25.14,
"t1": 26.25,
"text": "exciting."
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 26.25,
"t1": 27.76,
"text": "And here is the part that matters"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 27.76,
"t1": 29.29,
"text": "most. In all these"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 29.29,
"t1": 30.93,
"text": "years, in more than five"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 30.93,
"t1": 32.56,
"text": "hundred encounters, no one"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 32.56,
"t1": 34.2,
"text": "aboard has ever been hurt by"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 34.2,
"t1": 35.45,
"text": "these orcas."
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 35.45,
"t1": 37.33,
"text": "If they wanted to sink boats, scientists"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 37.33,
"t1": 39.01,
"text": "point out, they could have sunk"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 39.01,
"t1": 40.2,
"text": "hundreds by now."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.65,
"text": "In 2025, the"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 1.65,
"t1": 3.01,
"text": "game moved north."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 3.01,
"t1": 4.72,
"text": "On the thirteenth of September,"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 4.72,
"t1": 6.4,
"text": "a tourist yacht with five people"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 6.4,
"t1": 7.98,
"text": "aboard was struck again and"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 7.98,
"t1": 9.07,
"text": "again near Fonte da Telha,"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 9.07,
"t1": 10.15,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 10.15,
"t1": 11.65,
"text": "just south of Lisbon."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 11.65,
"t1": 13.45,
"text": "It went down bow first."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 13.45,
"t1": 15.12,
"text": "All five were rescued."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 15.12,
"t1": 16.88,
"text": "That same day, another boat"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 16.88,
"t1": 18.65,
"text": "was hit further up the coast,"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 18.65,
"t1": 20.27,
"text": "off Cascais."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 20.27,
"t1": 21.77,
"text": "Four weeks later, a"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 21.77,
"t1": 22.81,
"text": "French yacht called Ti'fare"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 22.81,
"t1": 23.85,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 23.85,
"t1": 25.4,
"text": "sank about fifty nautical"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 25.4,
"t1": 26.99,
"text": "miles off Peniche."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 26.99,
"t1": 28.66,
"text": "The family of five aboard"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 28.66,
"t1": 30.34,
"text": "climbed into a life raft"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 30.34,
"t1": 31.51,
"text": "and were picked up by a fishing boat."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 31.51,
"t1": 32.67,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 32.67,
"t1": 33.95,
"text": "Then, in August"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 33.95,
"t1": 35.72,
"text": "2026, people"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 35.72,
"t1": 36.73,
"text": "in the strait spotted To\u00f1i."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 36.73,
"t1": 37.75,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 37.75,
"t1": 39.3,
"text": "She is the oldest orca in"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 39.3,
"t1": 41.03,
"text": "the Strait of Gibraltar."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 41.03,
"t1": 42.58,
"text": "On the left side of her dorsal"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 42.58,
"t1": 44.08,
"text": "fin, there were about ten"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 44.08,
"t1": 45.62,
"text": "small holes."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 45.62,
"t1": 47.2,
"text": "Spain's environment ministry"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 47.2,
"t1": 48.76,
"text": "said they were consistent with pellet"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 48.76,
"t1": 50.05,
"text": "shots, and opened an"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 50.05,
"t1": 51.55,
"text": "investigation."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 51.55,
"t1": 53.1,
"text": "Just weeks earlier, her"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 53.1,
"t1": 54.73,
"text": "fin had been unmarked."
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.5,
"text": "This is not the first"
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 1.5,
"t1": 3.04,
"text": "time orcas have sunk a"
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 3.04,
"t1": 4.55,
"text": "boat. In June"
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 4.55,
"t1": 6.14,
"text": "1972,"
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 6.14,
"t1": 7.15,
"text": "west of the Galapagos Islands,"
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 7.15,
"t1": 8.16,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 8.16,
"t1": 10.07,
"text": "a family called the Robertsons"
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 10.07,
"t1": 11.71,
"text": "was sailing around the world on"
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 11.71,
"t1": 12.95,
"text": "a wooden schooner called Lucette."
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 12.95,
"t1": 14.18,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 14.18,
"t1": 15.73,
"text": "A group of killer whales struck"
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 15.73,
"t1": 17.61,
"text": "the hull. Within a minute,"
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 17.61,
"t1": 19.32,
"text": "the boat was gone."
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 19.32,
"t1": 20.97,
"text": "The family survived thirty-eight"
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 20.97,
"t1": 22.09,
"text": "days adrift in a tiny dinghy,"
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 22.09,
"t1": 23.21,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 23.21,
"t1": 24.81,
"text": "before a Japanese fishing boat"
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 24.81,
"t1": 25.84,
"text": "found them."
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 25.84,
"t1": 27.43,
"text": "What makes the Iberian orcas"
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 27.43,
"t1": 29.22,
"text": "different is not that they hit a boat"
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 29.22,
"t1": 30.93,
"text": "once. It is that a whole"
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 30.93,
"t1": 32.24,
"text": "family learned it."
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 32.24,
"t1": 33.99,
"text": "And kept doing it, year"
},
{
"scene": "16",
"t0": 33.99,
"t1": 34.95,
"text": "after year."
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.55,
"text": "So who are the real victims"
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 1.55,
"t1": 2.87,
"text": "in this story?"
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 2.87,
"t1": 4.41,
"text": "The orcas have broken hundreds"
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 4.41,
"t1": 5.98,
"text": "of rudders and sunk a"
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 5.98,
"t1": 7.41,
"text": "handful of boats."
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 7.41,
"t1": 9.12,
"text": "Every single person aboard those"
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 9.12,
"t1": 10.73,
"text": "boats has gone home."
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 10.73,
"t1": 12.55,
"text": "But there are still fewer than forty"
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 12.55,
"t1": 14.11,
"text": "Iberian orcas."
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 14.11,
"t1": 15.84,
"text": "Every one of them has a name."
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 15.84,
"t1": 17.49,
"text": "And now one of the oldest has"
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 17.49,
"t1": 19.05,
"text": "holes in her fin."
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 19.05,
"t1": 20.28,
"text": "Fads end."
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 20.28,
"t1": 22.06,
"text": "Young orcas grow up."
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 22.06,
"t1": 23.66,
"text": "One day, the Gladises may"
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 23.66,
"t1": 25.25,
"text": "simply stop, the way the"
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 25.25,
"t1": 26.78,
"text": "salmon hats stopped."
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 26.78,
"t1": 28.35,
"text": "The question is whether people will give"
},
{
"scene": "17",
"t0": 28.35,
"t1": 29.57,
"text": "them the chance."
}
]